# ML layer

- Change fusion only in `ml/fusion/model.py`
- Similarity public API stays in `ml/similarity/engine.py`
- Tests must run with `SIMILARITY_BACKEND=tfidf`
- Amazon/Yelp column mapping belongs in `ml/data/loaders/`
